{"id":"n60925-1-7","stage":4,"title":"빡빡하다 · 干巴巴","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60925-1-7-1","ko":"죽이 좀 빡빡하게 된 것 같은데?","zh":"粥好像煮得有点稠了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죽이","meaning":"粥","explanation":"죽：粥；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"죽","audio":"/audio/3bd31af8b11badee4ccb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91773","senseId":"1","lemma":"죽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죽이","audio":"/audio/54a638c697c63ef9ee91.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"빡빡하게","meaning":"干巴巴，稠乎乎，硬邦邦","explanation":"빡빡하다：干巴巴，稠乎乎，硬邦邦；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"빡빡하다","audio":"/audio/6c6c48b61c9da045dbe3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60925","senseId":"1","lemma":"빡빡하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빡빡하게","audio":"/audio/12a0903b95921465c1fe.mp3"}},{"text":"된","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48214","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"된","audio":"/audio/1c4305152ccc1be2241e.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"前面所说的事情或状态（-ㄴ/는 것 같다）","explanation":"것：前面所说的事情或状态（-ㄴ/는 것 같다）","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데?","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은데","audio":"/audio/09d1b4825a769d691604.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bd31af8b11badee","term":"죽","zh":"粥","audio":"/audio/3bd31af8b11badee4ccb.mp3","entryId":"91773","definition":"用大米或糯米等粮食长时间煮成的软烂的食物。","pronunciation":["죽"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"6c6c48b61c9da045","term":"빡빡하다","zh":"干巴巴，稠乎乎，硬邦邦","audio":"/audio/6c6c48b61c9da045dbe3.mp3","entryId":"60925","definition":"水分不足而不够柔软。","pronunciation":["빡빠카다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"48214","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되ː다","뒈ː다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"前面所说的事情或状态（-ㄴ/는 것 같다）","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"前面所说的事情或状态（-ㄴ/는 것 같다）","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/cf284953e14fc0327066.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60925-1-7-2","ko":"그럼 물을 더 넣을게요.","zh":"那我就再加点水吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"물을","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물을","audio":"/audio/46ddd583ad8778f3f0de.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"넣을게요.","meaning":"放入，加入","explanation":"넣다：放入，加入；을게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"2","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣을게요","audio":"/audio/76d82145875884771f20.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"再，多","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"添补而继续。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放入，加入","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使跟别的东西混合或参杂在一起。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/d6076d1e8362663fed69.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.51,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60925","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":127,"sequenceScore":2.3367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["粥好像煮得有点稠了？","那我就再加点水吧。","怎么这么惊讶？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["粥好像煮得有点稠了？","那我就再加点水吧。","怎么这么惊讶？"],"answer":1}]}
